  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AY13-QA-012" ;
  triage:title "ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F002: team-attribution message prefix ('team {team}: ...') is hand-written in three separate call sites" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1300-r1 (PR #1300, AY.13 doctor team scope). The 'attribute this finding/error message to its team' decision is implemented independently in three places introduced by this sprint: scope_finding (crates/atm-core/src/doctor/mod.rs), push_doctor_error_for_team (moved to crates/atm-core/src/doctor/team_scope.rs by the r2 split), and an inline format!(\"team {team}: skipped graft-receiver lease lookups: doctor budget exhausted\") literal inside graft_receivers_doctor_report (crates/atm-core/src/doctor/mod.rs). Each site hand-writes the same 'team {team}: ' prefix convention with no shared owner. Confirmed still present after the r2 doctor/mod.rs -> team_scope.rs split (the duplication crossed the new module boundary rather than being consolidated)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ay" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
