  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1300-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr independently confirmed via git show c0afd678d: added pub(super) fn team_message(team: &TeamName, message: impl AsRef<str>) -> String in team_scope.rs formatting the shared 'team {team}: {message}' convention, and all three former hand-written call sites (scope_finding in mod.rs, push_doctor_error_for_team in team_scope.rs, and the inline format! in graft_receivers_doctor_report in mod.rs) now delegate to team_scope::team_message instead of duplicating the literal. Personally-run cargo test -p agent-team-mail-core green and clippy clean at branch head cb13ca7e38 / current PR head 8ae936a37. Closing on this evidence." .
